    "detailed_description": "<strong> \u201cStanding pictures is strange! The story is also strange! Novel game where you can enjoy chaos!!\u201d</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description of this work</h2>Welcome to the world of novel game where you can enjoy chaos!<br>This game is a short story that is `easy`, `approachable`, and `for beginners to chaotic world`, aimed at those who are visiting this chaotic world for the first time.<br>Play time is about 2 hours. It has multiple endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>After the summer vacation of my third year of high school, my classmate 'Kirari Habataki' called out to me.<br>The `Kotoha Osaka' sitting next to me was wearing strange accessories.<br>And the homeroom teacher, who looks like a useless adult, says, `Komomo Mizukibashi.`<br><br>All the characters are in strange poses, but that's normal for this game. A school romance novel game set in a strange world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Standing pictures with strange poses are very Kawaii!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players are free to choose any of the frequently appearing options! All route branching points are indicated in-game, and there is no game over. You can concentrate on communicating with the heroine.</li></ul>",
